{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b6f2-9d0a-7aa4-a8ac-2d4637babbf5","session_id":"01a1b6f2-6f45-7d35-baf8-5b91db778dc4","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_8xioZ75qIFaraXCG4S211875","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   1→# T-002 实现说明\n   2→\n   3→对应 AC-005（levels: unit）。全部按 `.collab/tasks/002/design.md` 实现，只写了 write_scope 列出的路径\n   4→（外加本文件 `impl.md`）。基准提交：`f75bb76`。\n   5→\n   6→## 1. 交付物\n   7→\n   8→| 路径 | 内容 |\n   9→|---|---|\n  10→| `test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/` | 0.1 逐字节副本，恰好 7 个文件：`lib/{availability,cli,config,forecast,select}.mjs`、`lib/index.js`、`config/cliworker.example.json`（无 `package.json`、无 `bin/`、无说明文件） |\n  11→| `test/characterization/stable.test.mjs` | 6 条保留面用例，只 import 副本 |\n  12→| `test/characterization/frozen-files.json` | `source_commit` + 8 条登记（副本 7 + `stable.test.mjs`） |\n  13→| `test/characterization/defects.json` | 11 条缺陷，含 `owner_task`、`owner_milestone`、`ac`、`repro_sha256` |\n  14→| `test/characterization/defects/*.test.mjs` | 新建 10 个（`a3-runner` 保持 T-001 原样未改），每个文件一个 `[repro]` 段，无 `[fixed]` 段 |\n  15→| `test/characterization/canary/<id>/canary.json` | 11 个；9 个用 overlay，`a2-pack` / `a3-runner` 用 `repro_edits` |\n  16→| `test/characterization/canary/<id>/overlay/lib/*` | 9 组 0.1 的最小「已修复变体」，扩展名 `.mjs`，无 `*.test.mjs` |\n  17→| `test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs` | design §6 的 15 条用例（9 条 frozen + 6 条 defects） |\n  18→| `test/traceability/T-002.json` | AC-005 covered，两个测试文件 |\n  19→| `scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs` | 新建；导出 `checkFrozenFiles`、`contentHash`、`classifyPath` |\n  20→| `scripts/check-defects.mjs` | 追加 `extractReproSection`、`reproSha256`、`checkRepros` 与 `--strict`；原有导出与默认行为不变 |\n  21→\n  22→## 2. 关键实现决策\n  23→\n  24→### 2.1 副本与 hash 口径\n  25→\n  26→- 副本用「读工作树同路径文件 → 把所有 `\\r\\n` 换成 `\\n` → 写回」生成。design §0 已确认工作树的 `lib/`、\n  27→  `config/cliworker.example.json` 与 `f75bb76` 一致；blob 是 LF，所以该过程得到的就是 blob 字节。\n  28→  本轮已用验收 B-1 的原命令（只读的 `git ls-tree` / `git cat-file`，不改仓库）复核：stdout `ok 7`。\n  29→- `contentHash(buffer)` = `sha256(buffer.toString('latin1').replace(/\\r\\n/g, '\\n'), 'latin1')`，即\n  30→  「CRLF→LF 之后的原始字节」的 sha256，小写十六进制。用 latin1 往返保证非 ASCII 字节不被改动。\n  31→  因此 autocrlf 检出（CRLF）与 Linux 检出（LF）得到同一哈希。\n  32→- `frozen-files.json` 只登记：副本 7 个文件 + `test/characterization/stable.test.mjs`。没有登记\n  33→  `contracts/spec/ac-index.json`（T-001 的活索引，冻结会让后续加 AC 卡死 check-fast），也没有登记\n  34→  `contracts/golden/**`（当前不存在；T-004 的 `golden/manifest.json` 自带逐文件登记，本检查只要求\n  35→  「已登记的不被改动」）。\n  36→\n  37→### 2.2 `scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs`\n  38→\n  39→- 允许集合硬编码：前缀 `test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`、精确 `test/characterization/stable.test.mjs`、\n  40→  前缀 `contracts/spec/`、前缀 `contracts/golden/`。\n  41→- 判定顺序（每条登记）：JSON 结构 → 规范化 → `frozen.forbidden_path`（`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/`，大小写不敏感）\n  42→  → `frozen.outside_allowed`（绝对路径、盘符、反斜杠、`..`、不在允许集合）→ 读文件（`file_missing` / `hash_mismatch`）。\n  43→- 另外扫描副本目录与 `stable.test.mjs`，没有登记就 `frozen.unregistered`。\n  44→- 输出与 check-defects 同风格：`check-frozen-files: ok (<N> files)` / `FAIL <id> <detail>` + `check-frozen-files: FAILED (<n> errors)`；\n  45→  未知参数退出码 2。不调用 git、不读网络。\n  46→\n  47→### 2.3 `stable.test.mjs`\n  48→\n  49→- 两条静态 import：`../fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs`、`.../lib/config.mjs`。不 import `lib/`、`bin/`、\n  50→  `scripts/`，也不 import `lib/cli.mjs`（导入即 `main()`）。\n  51→- 保留面按 AC-005 括号里的四类硬编码（`contracts/spec/surfaces.json` 属 T-004，本分支还不存在）：\n  52→  弃用与未验证不入候选、等级过滤、exclude 原因优先、四个 schema 名（config / selection / model / handle）。\n  53→- 第 6 条用例读自身源码，断言所有以 `.` 开头的 import 说明符都含 `fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`。\n  54→\n  55→### 2.4 `[repro]` 段与 `repro_sha256`\n  56→\n  57→- 段 = 行首无缩进、以 `test('[repro]` 开头且以 `{` 结尾的行 → 其后第一个行首 `})` 行（含）。\n  58→- `extractReproSection(source)` 返回 `{ blocks, errors }`；`reproSha256(source)` = sha256(各块 CRLF→LF 后用 `\\n` 连接)，\n  59→  无段或格式错时返回 `null`。`defects.json` 的取值就是用同一函数生成的，检查也用它，口径唯一。\n  60→- 10 个新 repro 的标题都是 `[repro] [AC-005] ...`，块自包含（夹具、临时目录、环境变量还原、清理都在块内）；\n  61→  块外只有 `const V01 = process.env.CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT ?? fileURLToPath(new URL('../../fixtures/characterization/v0.1/', import.meta.url))`\n  62→  与 node 内置 import，副本一律用 `await import(pathToFileURL(path.join(V01, ...)))` 动态导入。\n  63→\n  64→### 2.5 canary 与 `checkRepros`\n  65→\n  66→- 每条缺陷两次运行：基线（原样副本）必须通过；canary（副本 + overlay + `repro_edits`）必须出现 `not ok <n> - [repro]`。\n  67→  只靠退出码非 0 不算命中，所以导入失败/语法错误不会被误判成 canary 成功。\n  68→- 临时根用 `fs.mkdtempSync(os.tmpdir()/cliworker-canary-)`，副本复制到 `<tmp>/v0.1` 并补 `package.json = {\"type\":\"module\"}`\n  69→  （副本里的 `lib/index.js` 需要它），repro 复制到 `<tmp>/repro.test.mjs`，其中 `.` 开头的 import 说明符按原文件所在\n  70→  目录改写成 `file://` 绝对 URL；运行 `node --test --test-reporter=tap --test-name-pattern=\\[repro\\]`，\n  71→  环境给 `CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT` 且删除 `NODE_TEST_CONTEXT`，超时 60s，结束后无条件删临时根。\n  72→- overlay 路径相对 v0.1 根校验（拒绝绝对路径、盘符、反斜杠、`..`）；`repro_edits[].find` 必须在 repro 源码中恰好出现一次。\n  73→\n  74→### 2.6 `check-defects` 严格模式（向后兼容）\n  75→\n  76→- 只有「不带 `--root`」或「带 `--strict`」才严格。`checkDefects({ root, index, milestone })` 的签名与返回值未变，\n  77→  `milestone-gate.mjs` 的调用不走严格分支，T-001 的 `test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs` 6 条全绿。\n  78→- 严格模式在原有检查之上：账本 id 集合必须恰为 11 个（复用 `defects.set_mismatch`，已存在则不重复加），\n  79→  并对每条缺陷调用 `checkRepros`。错误行格式 `FAIL <id> <defect-id> <detail>`。\n  80→\n  81→## 3. 验收自测结果（r1 + r2 复核）\n  82→\n  83→r1 建立交付物；r2 重跑全部验收命令，结果与 r1 一致（两处阻塞未变，均在写域外，见 §4）。\n  84→B-3–B-6、C-2、D-4–D-6 用 bash 的 `mktemp -d` + `cp -r` 复现 pwsh 脚本的同样步骤（临时目录副本，不动仓库）。\n  85→\n  86→| 项 | 命令 | 结果 |\n  87→|---|---|---|\n  88→| A-1 | `node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-005` | 通过：`filtered 12 files`，31 tests / 0 fail，6 条 stable + 15 条 frozen/defects + 10 条 `[repro] [AC-005]` 全 ✔ |\n  89→| A-2 | `node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs` | 通过：`check-frozen-files: ok (8 files)` |\n  90→| A-3 | `node scripts/check-defects.mjs` | 通过：`check-defects: ok`（严格模式，11 条 canary 全部命中） |\n  91→| A-4 | `node scripts/check-fast.mjs` | **失败**，见 §4.1（停在 `check-ci.mjs`，与本任务无关） |\n  92→| A-5 | `node scripts/run-tests.mjs` | **失败 2 条**，见 §4.1、§4.2（69 tests / 67 pass） |\n  93→| B-1 | git 对比 7 个 blob | 通过：按验收命令原样执行（只读 plumbing），stdout 恰为 `ok 7` |\n  94→| B-2 | 形状与允许集合 | 通过：`ok 8` |\n  95→| B-3 | 篡改一个登记字节 | 通过：`FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch .../lib/select.mjs` + `FAILED (1 errors)`，exit 1 |\n  96→| B-4 | 登记 lib/bin/config/scripts | 通过：3 条 `frozen.forbidden_path` + 1 条 `frozen.outside_allowed`，`FAILED (4 errors)`，exit 1 |\n  97→| B-5 | 副本多一个未登记文件 | 通过：`FAIL frozen.unregistered .../README.md`，exit 1 |\n  98→| B-6 | `--bogus` | 通过：exit 2 |\n  99→| C-1 | 相对 import 全指向副本 | 通过：`ok 2` |\n 100→| C-2 | 改坏副本的 `reason: 'excluded'` | 通过：`not ok 4 - [AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded`，exit 1 |\n 101→| D-1 | defects.json 内容 | 通过：`ok 11` |\n 102→| D-2 | repro / canary / 无 `*.test.mjs` | 通过：`ok` |\n 103→| D-3 | `[repro]` 与 `[fixed]` 分离 | 通过：`ok 10` |\n 104→| D-4 | 篡改 `[repro]` 段 | 通过：含 `FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call`，exit 1（另有 1 条 a3-runner 基线失败，见 §5 备注） |\n 105→| D-5 | canary 覆盖文件换成 0.1 原文 | 通过：含 `FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call`，且无其它 `canary_survived`，exit 1 |\n 106→| D-6 | 删掉 `canary/a4-paths` | 通过：含 `FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths`，exit 1 |\n 107→| D-7 | `node --test test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs` | 通过：6/6，无 ✖ |\n 108→| E-1 | `check-traceability` + T-002.json 形状 | 通过：`ok (covered=6 planned=68)`、`ok` |\n 109→| E-2 | 写域检查 | 通过：改动只在 write_scope 内（+ `.collab/tasks/002/impl.md`） |\n 110→| E-3 | 无第三方依赖 / 无令牌 | 通过：`ok` |\n 111→\n 112→## 4. 未通过项与根因\n 113→\n 114→这两项都不在本任务写域内，改动它们会同时破坏 E-2，因此保持原样并在此记录。\n 115→\n 116→### 4.1 check-ci 因 CRLF 检出失败（阻塞 A-4，并使 A-5 少一条）\n 117→\n 118→- 现象：`node scripts/check-ci.mjs` → `FAIL ci.stale .github/workflows/ci.yml is not the current generated output`；\n 119→  `check-fast` 在第一步 `check-ci.mjs` 就退出，走不到 `check-defects.mjs` / `check-frozen-files.mjs` / `npm test`。\n 120→- 证据：`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在盘上有 57 个 CRLF、`renderCi()` 生成 0 个 CRLF；把实际文件 CRLF→LF 后与\n 121→  生成结果**逐字符相等**（`r === a.replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n')` 为 true）。即内容没变，只是 `core.autocrlf=true`\n 122→  的检出换行（design §0 也写了本机 autocrlf=true、仓库无 `.gitattributes`）。\n 123→- 影响面：与 T-002 无关，`.github/` 与 `scripts/check-ci.mjs` 均未被我改动；同一失败也出现在\n 124→  `test/unit/runner-selftest.test.mjs` 的 `[AC-002] check-ci accepts the committed workflow`。\n 125→- 已验证该失败之外的 A-4 内容：在临时根里放 `scripts/`、`test/`、`contracts/`、`package.json`、`.github/` 并把\n 126→  `ci.yml` 归一化成 LF，`node scripts/check-ci.mjs --root <tmp>` → `check-ci: ok`；同一临时根下其余检查也全绿。\n 127→  在真实仓库里，`check-defects.mjs` / `check-frozen-files.mjs` / `check-test-discovery.mjs` / `check-traceability.mjs`\n 128→  与 `npm test` 均已单独跑过且通过（见 §3、§7），所以 A-4 只差 `check-ci` 这一根堵塞点。\n 129→- 最小修复（属 T-001 / 后续任务）：让 check-ci 比较前把两侧 CRLF→LF 归一化，或提交 `.gitattributes` 固定 LF。\n 130→  修好后 A-4 只剩 A-5 那一项。\n 131→\n 132→### 4.2 T-001 的 AC-004 用例把「AC-005 尚未有分片」写死了（阻塞 A-5）\n 133→\n 134→- 现象：`test/unit/traceability.test.mjs` 的 `[AC-004] mergeShards treats ACs without a shard as planned`\n 135→  断言 `merged.acs['AC-005'] === 'planned'`，本任务按 design §7 / 验收 E-1 提交 `T-002.json`（AC-005 `covered`）后，\n 136→  该断言变成 `actual 'covered' / expected 'planned'`，全量运行 1 条红。\n 137→- 这是规格内部的直接冲突：design §7 与 E-1 要求 AC-005 = `covered`，而 T-001 的用例用它当「没有分片的 AC」样例。\n 138→  只要 AC-005 被本任务覆盖，该断言必然失效，与本任务实现无关。\n 139→- 最小修复（属 T-001 / 后续任务）：把该断言换成另一个确实没有分片的 AC（例如 `AC-006`），或改成从 index 里挑一个\n 140→  「未被任何分片声明的 AC」。一行替换即可，不涉及逻辑变更。\n 141→- 我没有直接改：`test/unit/traceability.test.mjs` 不在 write_scope，改它会让 E-2（写域检查）直接变红，净效果不划算。\n 142→\n 143→## 5. 备注\n 144→\n 145→- D-4/D-5/D-6 的临时根只复制了 `test/` 与 `contracts/`（与验收脚本一致），`a3-runner` 的 repro 依赖\n 146→  `../../../scripts/run-tests.mjs`，在该临时根里不存在，于是额外出现一条\n 147→  `FAIL defects.repro_baseline_failed a3-runner`。验收对这三项的判据只要求出现目标行、且 D-5 不得有其它\n 148→  `canary_survived`，均满足；真实仓库（A-3）没有这条噪声。\n 149→- `defects.json` 的 `repro_sha256` 是用 `scripts/check-defects.mjs` 导出的 `reproSha256` 生成的，可与\n 150→  `node --input-type=module -e \"import {reproSha256} from './scripts/check-defects.mjs'; ...\"` 复核。\n 151→- 本任务不接触任何密钥；repro 与临时目录里只有构造出来的假配置，日志与改动文件里没有令牌。\n 152→\n 153→## 6. 自测命令\n 154→\n 155→```bash\n 156→node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-005\n 157→node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs\n 158→node scripts/check-defects.mjs\n 159→node --test test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs\n 160→node --test test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs\n 161→node scripts/check-traceability.mjs\n 162→node scripts/run-tests.mjs\n 163→```\n 164→\n 165→## 7. r2 复核记录\n 166→\n 167→本轮没有改动任何交付物代码，只重跑了验收；结论与 r1 相同。逐条实测（Windows，Node v22）：\n 168→\n 169→| 项 | 实测输出 |\n 170→|---|---|\n 171→| A-1 | `run-tests: filtered 12 files`，`ℹ tests 31 / pass 31 / fail 0`；6 条 `stable:`、9 条 `frozen:`、6 条 `defects:`、10 条 `[repro] [AC-005]` 全 ✔ |\n 172→| A-2 | `check-frozen-files: ok (8 files)`，exit 0 |\n 173→| A-3 | `check-defects: ok`，exit 0（严格模式，11 条 canary 全部命中） |\n 174→| A-4 | exit 1，停在 `check-ci.mjs`（§4.1） |\n 175→| A-5 | `run-tests: full 17 files`，`ℹ tests 69 / pass 67 / fail 2`：`[AC-002] check-ci accepts the committed workflow`（§4.1）与 `[AC-004] mergeShards ... planned`（§4.2）；其余全绿，含 `[repro] 0.1 has no test script` |\n 176→| B-1 | `ok 7` |\n 177→| B-2 | `ok 8` |\n 178→| B-3 | `FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch .../v0.1/lib/select.mjs` + `FAILED (1 errors)`，exit 1 |\n 179→| B-4 | 3×`frozen.forbidden_path` + `frozen.outside_allowed scripts/run-tests.mjs` + `FAILED (4 errors)`，exit 1 |\n 180→| B-5 | `FAIL frozen.unregistered .../v0.1/README.md`，exit 1 |\n 181→| B-6 | exit 2 |\n 182→| C-1 | `ok 2` |\n 183→| C-2 | `not ok 4 - [AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded`，exit 1 |\n 184→| D-1 / D-2 / D-3 | `ok 11` / `ok` / `ok 10` |\n 185→| D-4 | 含 `FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call`，exit 1（另有 §5 说明的 a3-runner 噪声） |\n 186→| D-5 | 含 `FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call`，无其它 `canary_survived`，exit 1 |\n 187→| D-6 | 含 `FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths`，exit 1 |\n 188→| D-7 | `ℹ tests 6 / pass 6 / fail 0` |\n 189→| E-1 | `check-traceability: ok (covered=6 planned=68)`；T-002.json 形状 `ok` |\n 190→| E-3 | `ok` |\n 191→| F | 11 个 `node --test --test-name-pattern=\"\\[repro\\]\"` 逐个跑：每个 `# pass 1 / # fail 0`，exit 0 |\n 192→\n 193→§4.1 的根因本轮改用「临时根里把 `ci.yml` 归一化成 LF 再跑 `check-ci`」复核（全程不碰仓库文件）：\n 194→`node scripts/check-ci.mjs --root <tmp>` → `check-ci: ok`。即失败只由 `core.autocrlf=true` 的检出换行引起，\n 195→与 `ci.yml` 内容、与本任务实现都无关。\n 196→\n 197→范围：本轮只重写了本文件；`git status --porcelain` 里落在写域外的只有 `.collab/tasks/002/` 编排产物。\n 198→"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18","_messageId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","traceparent":"00-8c189397b78cdd89b11e93157a3f70f9-b888e2f0ff5c2668-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6f2-6f45-7d35-baf8-5b91db778dc4,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:58:35.660Z"}
{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b6f2-9d17-727f-9eff-90bb4d727c50","session_id":"01a1b6f2-6f45-7d35-baf8-5b91db778dc4","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_01_aJwCupOORXIkiziwyiNc3099","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stdout: {\r\n  \"name\": \"dsh-cliworker\",\r\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\r\n  \"description\": \"DSH plugin: independent CLI/model layer for AgentLine (providers, models, availability, cost, selection).\",\r\n  \"type\": \"module\",\r\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\r\n  \"exports\": {\r\n    \".\": \"./lib/index.js\",\r\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"test\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs\",\r\n    \"check\": \"node scripts/check-fast.mjs\",\r\n    \"perf\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --perf\",\r\n    \"snapshot:update\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --update-snapshots\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"dsh\": {\r\n    \"bundle\": {\r\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"files\": [\r\n    \"lib\",\r\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\r\n    \"dsh.plugin.json\",\r\n    \"README.md\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"engines\": {\r\n    \"node\": \">=20\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"license\": \"MIT\"\r\n}\r\n----\nconfig/cliworker.local.json\r\nusage.jsonl\r\nnode_modules/\r\n.collab/worktrees/\r\n----\nac-index.json\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env node\r\n// Verifies that .github/workflows/ci.yml is the current output of gen-ci.mjs for ci-matrix.json.\r\nimport fs from 'node:fs'\r\nimport path from 'node:path'\r\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url'\r\n\r\nimport { renderCi } from './gen-ci.mjs'\r\n\r\nconst HERE = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))\r\nconst REPO_ROOT = path.resolve(HERE, '..')\r\n\r\nconst EXPECTED_OS = ['macos', 'ubuntu', 'windows']\r\nconst EXPECTED_NODE = [20, 22]\r\nconst EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS = ['files-executed.json', 'skips.jsonl']\r\nconst CHECK_COMMAND = 'npm run check'\r\n\r\nfunction sortedCopy(value) {\r\n  return Array.isArray(value) ? [...value].sort() : null\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction sameArray(actual, expected) {\r\n  if (!Array.isArray(actual) || actual.length !== expected.length) return false\r\n  return actual.every((item, i) => item === expected[i])\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction validateMatrix(matrix) {\r\n  const problems = []\r\n  if (!matrix || typeof matrix !== 'object' || Array.isArray(matrix)) {\r\n    problems.push('matrix must be a JSON object')\r\n    return problems\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const names = sortedCopy((Array.isArray(matrix.os) ? matrix.os : []).map((item) => item && item.name))\r\n  if (!names || !sameArray(names, EXPECTED_OS)) {\r\n    problems.push(`os names must be ${EXPECTED_OS.join('|')}`)\r\n  }\r\n  if (!sameArray(matrix.node, EXPECTED_NODE)) {\r\n    problems.push(`node must be ${EXPECTED_NODE.join(',')}`)\r\n  }\r\n  if (matrix.check_command !== CHECK_COMMAND) {\r\n    problems.push(`check_command must be \"${CHECK_COMMAND}\"`)\r\n  }\r\n  if (!sameArray(matrix.artifacts, EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS)) {\r\n    problems.push(`artifacts must be ${EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS.join(',')}`)\r\n  }\r\n  if (!matrix.perf || matrix.perf.blocking !== false) {\r\n    problems.push('perf.blocking must be false')\r\n  }\r\n  return problems\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function checkCi(root = REPO_ROOT) {\r\n  const errors = []\r\n  const matrixFile = path.join(root, 'scripts', 'ci-matrix.json')\r\n  const workflowFile = path.join(root, '.github', 'workflows', 'ci.yml')\r\n\r\n  let matrix = null\r\n  try {\r\n    matrix = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(matrixFile, 'utf8'))\r\n  } catch {\r\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.matrix_invalid', detail: `cannot read ${matrixFile}` })\r\n    return errors\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const problems = validateMatrix(matrix)\r\n  if (problems.length > 0) {\r\n    for (const problem of problems) errors.push({ id: 'ci.matrix_invalid', detail: problem })\r\n    return errors\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  let actual = null\r\n  try {\r\n    actual = fs.readFileSync(workflowFile, 'utf8')\r\n  } catch {\r\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.missing', detail: '.github/workflows/ci.yml is missing' })\r\n    return errors\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const expected = renderCi(matrix)\r\n  if (actual !== expected) {\r\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.stale', detail: '.github/workflows/ci.yml is not the current generated output' })\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  if (!expected.includes('continue-on-error: true')) {\r\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.perf_blocking', detail: 'perf job is missing continue-on-error: true' })\r\n  }\r\n  if (expected.includes('needs: perf')) {\r\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.perf_blocking', detail: 'a job depends on perf' })\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return errors\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction main() {\r\n  const args = process.argv.slice(2)\r\n  let root = REPO_ROOT\r\n\r\n  for (let i = 0; i < args.length; i += 1) {\r\n    const flag = args[i]\r\n    if (flag === '--root') {\r\n      const value = args[i + 1]\r\n      if (typeof value !== 'string' || value === '') {\r\n        process.stderr.write('--root requires a directory\\n')\r\n        process.exitCode = 2\r\n        return\r\n      }\r\n      root = path.resolve(value)\r\n      i += 1\r\n    } else {\r\n      process.stderr.write(`unknown argument: ${flag}\\nusage: node scripts/check-ci.mjs [--root <dir>]\\n`)\r\n      process.exitCode = 2\r\n      return\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const errors = checkCi(root)\r\n  if (errors.length === 0) {\r\n    process.stdout.write('check-ci: ok\\n')\r\n    process.exitCode = 0\r\n    return\r\n  }\r\n  for (const error of errors) process.stdout.write(`FAIL ${error.id} ${error.detail}\\n`)\r\n  process.stdout.write(`check-ci: FAILED (${errors.length} errors)\\n`)\r\n  process.exitCode = 1\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst invokedDirectly =\r\n  process.argv[1] && path.resolve(process.argv[1]).toLowerCase() === fileURLToPath(import.meta.url).toLowerCase()\r\n\r\nif (invokedDirectly) main()\r\n\nStderr: (empty)\nExit Code: 0\nSignal: (none)"}],"is_error":false,"_meta":{"rawResponse":{"exitCode":0,"signal":null,"interrupted":false,"sandboxDenied":false,"stderrBytesTruncated":0,"stdoutBytesTruncated":0,"tool_error_code":"0"},"renderer":{"type":"text","value":"{\n  \"name\": \"dsh-cliworker\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"DSH plugin: independent CLI/model layer for AgentLine (providers, models, availability, cost, selection).\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": \"./lib/index.js\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs\",\n    \"check\": \"node scripts/check-fast.mjs\",\n    \"perf\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --perf\",\n    \"snapshot:update\": \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --update-snapshots\"\n  },\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"lib\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"dsh.plugin.json\",\n    \"README.md\"\n  ],\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=20\"\n  },\n  \"license\": \"MIT\"\n}\n----\nconfig/cliworker.local.json\nusage.jsonl\nnode_modules/\n.collab/worktrees/\n----\nac-index.json\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env node\n// Verifies that .github/workflows/ci.yml is the current output of gen-ci.mjs for ci-matrix.json.\nimport fs from 'node:fs'\nimport path from 'node:path'\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url'\n\nimport { renderCi } from './gen-ci.mjs'\n\nconst HERE = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))\nconst REPO_ROOT = path.resolve(HERE, '..')\n\nconst EXPECTED_OS = ['macos', 'ubuntu', 'windows']\nconst EXPECTED_NODE = [20, 22]\nconst EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS = ['files-executed.json', 'skips.jsonl']\nconst CHECK_COMMAND = 'npm run check'\n\nfunction sortedCopy(value) {\n  return Array.isArray(value) ? [...value].sort() : null\n}\n\nfunction sameArray(actual, expected) {\n  if (!Array.isArray(actual) || actual.length !== expected.length) return false\n  return actual.every((item, i) => item === expected[i])\n}\n\nfunction validateMatrix(matrix) {\n  const problems = []\n  if (!matrix || typeof matrix !== 'object' || Array.isArray(matrix)) {\n    problems.push('matrix must be a JSON object')\n    return problems\n  }\n\n  const names = sortedCopy((Array.isArray(matrix.os) ? matrix.os : []).map((item) => item && item.name))\n  if (!names || !sameArray(names, EXPECTED_OS)) {\n    problems.push(`os names must be ${EXPECTED_OS.join('|')}`)\n  }\n  if (!sameArray(matrix.node, EXPECTED_NODE)) {\n    problems.push(`node must be ${EXPECTED_NODE.join(',')}`)\n  }\n  if (matrix.check_command !== CHECK_COMMAND) {\n    problems.push(`check_command must be \"${CHECK_COMMAND}\"`)\n  }\n  if (!sameArray(matrix.artifacts, EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS)) {\n    problems.push(`artifacts must be ${EXPECTED_ARTIFACTS.join(',')}`)\n  }\n  if (!matrix.perf || matrix.perf.blocking !== false) {\n    problems.push('perf.blocking must be false')\n  }\n  return problems\n}\n\nexport function checkCi(root = REPO_ROOT) {\n  const errors = []\n  const matrixFile = path.join(root, 'scripts', 'ci-matrix.json')\n  const workflowFile = path.join(root, '.github', 'workflows', 'ci.yml')\n\n  let matrix = null\n  try {\n    matrix = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(matrixFile, 'utf8'))\n  } catch {\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.matrix_invalid', detail: `cannot read ${matrixFile}` })\n    return errors\n  }\n\n  const problems = validateMatrix(matrix)\n  if (problems.length > 0) {\n    for (const problem of problems) errors.push({ id: 'ci.matrix_invalid', detail: problem })\n    return errors\n  }\n\n  let actual = null\n  try {\n    actual = fs.readFileSync(workflowFile, 'utf8')\n  } catch {\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.missing', detail: '.github/workflows/ci.yml is missing' })\n    return errors\n  }\n\n  const expected = renderCi(matrix)\n  if (actual !== expected) {\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.stale', detail: '.github/workflows/ci.yml is not the current generated output' })\n  }\n\n  if (!expected.includes('continue-on-error: true')) {\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.perf_blocking', detail: 'perf job is missing continue-on-error: true' })\n  }\n  if (expected.includes('needs: perf')) {\n    errors.push({ id: 'ci.perf_blocking', detail: 'a job depends on perf' })\n  }\n\n  return errors\n}\n\nfunction main() {\n  const args = process.argv.slice(2)\n  let root = REPO_ROOT\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < args.length; i += 1) {\n    const flag = args[i]\n    if (flag === '--root') {\n      const value = args[i + 1]\n      if (typeof value !== 'string' || value === '') {\n        process.stderr.write('--root requires a directory\\n')\n        process.exitCode = 2\n        return\n      }\n      root = path.resolve(value)\n      i += 1\n    } else {\n      process.stderr.write(`unknown argument: ${flag}\\nusage: node scripts/check-ci.mjs [--root <dir>]\\n`)\n      process.exitCode = 2\n      return\n    }\n  }\n\n  const errors = checkCi(root)\n  if (errors.length === 0) {\n    process.stdout.write('check-ci: ok\\n')\n    process.exitCode = 0\n    return\n  }\n  for (const error of errors) process.stdout.write(`FAIL ${error.id} ${error.detail}\\n`)\n  process.stdout.write(`check-ci: FAILED (${errors.length} errors)\\n`)\n  process.exitCode = 1\n}\n\nconst invokedDirectly =\n  process.argv[1] && path.resolve(process.argv[1]).toLowerCase() === fileURLToPath(import.meta.url).toLowerCase()\n\nif (invokedDirectly) main()"}}}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18","_messageId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6f290487313a779b486141a01ef","traceparent":"00-8c189397b78cdd89b11e93157a3f70f9-b888e2f0ff5c2668-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6f2-6f45-7d35-baf8-5b91db778dc4,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6f274007f9ba4742a03dd411b18"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:58:35.673Z"}
